+# Corpus fetching
+
+The corpus fetch had to respect a per-domain limit of **12 visits per
+60-second window**. After breaching that limit, the fetcher imposed a
+**900-second (15-minute) cooldown** for the affected domain.
+
+Files were fetched through these hosts:
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com`
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net`, using paths of the form
+  `/gh/<owner>/<repo>@<branch>/<path>`
+- `cdn.statically.io`
+
+The `cdn.statically.io` mirror was used, but was slow and produced timeouts
+during the fetch.
